      "motionStyles": {
        "Ken Burns": {
          "name": "Ken Burns",
          "explanation": "Hero photo + list highlight: zoom push-in, hold, zoom/fade out; first entry reuses punch-in; last exit reuses punch-out.",
          "windUp": 0,
          "punchIn": 3.4,
          "hold": 1,
          "punchOut": 0.45,
          "windDown": 0,
          "notes": "ENGINE: Sequential blocks. Mid-run item = Punch-in → Hold → Punch-out.\nFirst item entrance = Wind-up if >0 else Punch-in.\nLast item exit = Wind-down if >0 else Punch-out.\n0 on Wind-up/Wind-down means “no override” (not “no animation”).\n\nKEN BURNS defaults (seconds):\n- Wind-up 0 → first slide uses Punch-in 3.4 (scale 0.93→1, ease-out; opacity in ≤0.45 ease-fade)\n- Punch-in 3.4 → every slide focus-in\n- Hold 3 → settled only (zoom=1, highlight on); not including punch\n- Punch-out 0.45 → every mid-run exit (scale 1→0.93 + fade, ease-fade)\n- Wind-down 0 → last slide uses Punch-out 0.45\n\nLater: set Wind-up or Wind-down >0 only when first/last should differ from normal punch.\n\nSo both ends default to the same punch behavior; the Wind columns stay free for real first/last overrides when you want them."
        },
        "Slideshow": {
          "name": "Slideshow",
          "explanation": "Just still images with opacity fades in between. Simple.",
          "windUp": 0,
          "punchIn": 3.4,
          "hold": 1,
          "punchOut": 0.45,
          "windDown": 0,
          "notes": ""
        },
        "Encore": {
          "name": "Encore",
          "explanation": "",
          "windUp": 0,
          "punchIn": 2,
          "hold": 1,
          "punchOut": 0.45,
          "windDown": 0,
          "notes": "ENGINE: Same block runner + same digit rules as Ken Burns / Slideshow.\nWind-up/Wind-down 0 = use Punch-In / Punch-Out DURATIONS for first/last (not “no animation”).\nSame cell values ⇒ same phase lengths as KB/Slideshow.\n\nENCORE ≠ “Ken Burns with veil only.” Opacity TARGET depends on phase:\n\nWIND-UP & WIND-DOWN (inherit KB/Slideshow opacity behavior PRECISELY):\n- GRID (full collage) opacity in/out — same role as hero image opacity on KB/Slideshow.\n- VEIL also participates on Wind-up (see kicker) / Wind-down as part of that entrance/exit.\n- Camera/zoom as Encore focus treatment.\n\nPUNCH-IN & PUNCH-OUT (mid-run item↔item):\n- GRID does NOT opacity-fade (stays up).\n- VEIL ONLY opacity changes (in on Punch-In, out on Punch-Out), using Punch-In / Punch-Out time values from this row (same numbers as KB/Slideshow when cells match).\n- Camera moves focus item↔item; highlight locksteps with punch.\n\nHOLD: Settled on active item (veil + zoom parked). Duration = Hold cell.\n\nKICKER — Wind-up when Family Portrait DISABLED:\nSingle entrance duration (Wind-Up if >0 else Punch-In). THREE PARALLEL tracks:\n  (1) grid opacity 0→1\n  (2) veil opacity → focused on top-billed item\n  (3) camera zoom from full-spread overview → top-billed lattice point\nAll finish on that entrance clock. Not sequential sub-phases.\n\nWind-down (last of segment; duration Wind-Down if >0 else Punch-Out):\nGrid opacity out + veil out (KB/Slideshow-style full exit), camera settles; then next segment entrance.\n\nFAMILY PORTRAIT (build AFTER Encore satisfactory):\n- Optional one-slide full-spread overview BEFORE Encore bows when FP toggle ON.\n- Not the same as Encore Wind-up cell; FP is extra pre-show beat.\n- Encore without FP: kicker Wind-up above.\n- FP without Encore: later, with other styles.\n\nSEGMENT HANDOFF: last exit / first entrance by segment boundary (Alpha → Drinks etc.) even if both Encore or Encore↔Slideshow/Ken Burns.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION: Engine phases + multi-target treatments (grid vs veil vs camera). Quarantine for lattice/veil reference only. Log style=Encore, phase, surfaces={grid,veil,camera}, seconds"
        }
      },
